msgid ""
"Deprecated. Use "
":meth:`pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_long_positions`. Maximum number"
" of long positions that can be held at any time in "
":class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio`. Unlimited when ``None``. Defaults "
"to ``None``."
msgstr ""

